      mnemonic: "MUSTN'T = MURDER (o'ldirish mumkin emas — qat'iy taqiq). DON'T HAVE TO = optional (ixtiyoriy — xohlasang qil, xohlamasang qilma). Mustn't = NO! Don't have to = MAYBE NOT.",
