      mnemonic: "MUST BE = Mening fikrimcha, shunday bo'lsa kerak (taxmin). MUST = Majburiy, qilish kerak (obligation). 'Must be' dan keyin odatda sifat yoki V3 keladi. 'Must' dan keyin V1 keladi.",
      commonMistakes: "'She must be tired' ni 'U charchashi kerak' deb tarjima qilish xato. Bu 'U charchagan bo'lsa kerak' (taxmin). 'She must rest' = 'U dam olishi kerak' (majburiyat).",
